NGまたはPSD\n・背景と人物のレイヤーが分かれているPSD\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。\n\n殿耀月乃\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1z4Nd5R2-4L_MUDcY5SZ6_o8COyr0H9Zr", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 2235, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "山口カエ＠連載準備中", "screen_name": "yamakae", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1535543400870854657/s1PHaKp0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/193510019/1403139072/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 0}, {"id": 5184, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "HER / デザフェス両日 西１階 F-359ライブペイント", "screen_name": "her_tokyo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1556571997278072832/oCd65IGo.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/891272068305526784/1649814559/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 152}, {"id": 463285, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "カヂロ/𝙠𝙖𝙙𝙞𝙧𝙤🐶", "screen_name": "kadikadisake", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1942938694446350336/aPameGpg.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/211089509/1727182314/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expirati